# TikTok (international app and web)
# ByteDance CN (douyin.com, toutiao.com, ixigua.com, bytedance.com, pstatp.com,
# byteimg.com) is omitted so later ChinaDomain / GEOIP,CN can DIRECT those.
# CapCut / Trae / Marscode are omitted (Trae / Marscode live in ai.list).
# AppsFlyer and other shared attribution hosts are omitted.
#
# Why this list exists:
# ACL4SSR ProxyMedia only has a short TikTok block and loads late as Foreign Media.
# Android also dials snssdk.com / isnssdk.com and raw IPs; snssdk.com sits in
# ChinaDomain (DIRECT) and raw IPs hit GEOIP,CN — same class of leak as Binance.
# PROCESS-NAME forces the Play Store / Trill packages through this group.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Process
# Desktop binary + Windows .exe + Android package. PROCESS-NAME is the reliable
# fix for apps that dial raw IPs that would otherwise match GEOIP,CN / ChinaIp.
# Douyin (com.ss.android.ugc.aweme) is omitted on purpose.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROCESS-NAME,TikTok
PROCESS-NAME,TikTok.exe
PROCESS-NAME,com.zhiliaoapp.musically
PROCESS-NAME,com.zhiliaoapp.musically.go
PROCESS-NAME,com.ss.android.ugc.trill

# Keywords (Akamai / Fastly hosts like p16-tiktokcdn-com.akamaized.net)
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,tiktokcdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,tiktok
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,musical.ly

# Core first-party
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokv.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokv.us
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokv.eu
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokw.us
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokw.eu
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn-us.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn-eu.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokcdn-in.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokrow-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokeu-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttcdn-us.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokd.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokd.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tik-tokapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktok-row.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktok-minis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokminis.us
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokmusic.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tiktokglobalshopv.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,musical.ly
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muscdn.com

# ByteDance international (not the CN snssdk / pstatp / byteimg siblings)
# snssdk.com is shared with Douyin; it must still win over ChinaDomain DIRECT
# or the Android app cannot reach the API.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteoversea.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteoversea.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibytedtos.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ibyteimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ipstatp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sgpstatp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,isnssdk.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sgsnssdk.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,snssdk.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteintlapi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,byteintl.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytegecko-i18n.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytedapm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttwebview.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttwstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttlivecdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttoversea.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ttoverseaus.net

